The Chat surface was moved out of the Ponpoko host repository, which declares no licence file at
the commit the move was made from. Until that repository's licence is decided, this bundle
asserts no licence of its own and grants no rights beyond what the host's terms already give.

Do not replace this file with an invented licence. Replace it only with the licence the source
actually carries, and record that decision in docs/provenance.md.
